NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/agent.Agent.act kind=method
  digest=b3:5a9f4d1244f7b131adb2004e12b3473fc4aedfae19a078a0f8d4e4a6379e2f1a file=neo/internal/agent/agent.go range=1223:1309 lang=go exported=false byte_range=54675:59290
  sig=func (a *Agent) act(ctx context.Context, step, pct int, res *llm.ChatResult) error
  doc=act is the act stage (MORPHEUS req.3.1): narration, the governor's outer\nfailsafe commit for this batch, and tool dispatch with result assembly.\nContract — inputs: the step index, this\nstep's context-fill pct, and the tool-calling model result; mutates: the\nworking transcript (tool results, guidance), the turn's stall bookkeeping\nand counters, the loop snapshot, and the epistemic run state (via the\nobserve seams); returns a terminal error (via governDeath) on a stall death\nor the unproductive-cap escalation, nil otherwise. (The failsafe commit\nstays after the preamble narration for order fidelity; its verdict comes\nfrom the unified signal state computed at deliberate.)
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/neo/internal/agent.Agent
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/agent/agent.go

