  doc=signals is the unified per-step signal state (MORPHEUS req.5.1),\ncomputed ONCE at deliberate entry and replaced every step. All\nself-correction consumers — the stall commit (noteBatch), the Cassandra\ncontroller, the governor — read this one state.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/neo/internal/agent.turn

NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/agent.turn#sourceFetchNudges kind=field
  digest=b3:a955c095514ff816813b61cb2f67355eb712e7355bba0c2c8193ccfe4e55cc4b file=neo/internal/agent/turn.go range=157:162 lang=go exported=false byte_range=7413:7763
  sig=int
  doc=sourceFetchNudges counts how many times the source-fetch close guard has\nsteered THIS turn. Past sourceFetchNudgeCap it stands down for the same\nreason as overflowNudges: when every fetch of a discovered URL fails, the\nguard's precondition is unachievable and holding the answer hostage only\nspends the turn.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/neo/internal/agent.turn

